(The BlobBoard contract is a stateless event board that allows anyone to post blobs of ciphertext. It implements) Tj
T* (basic validation for blob size and emits events with relevant metadata. The contract is secure against common) Tj
T* (vulnerabilities like reentrancy, access control issues, integer overflows, and external interaction risks due to its) Tj
T* (stateless nature. However, it lacks any form of rate limiting or spam protection which could be considered a medium) Tj
T* (risk in certain use cases.) Tj
